000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. DATETEST.
000300*    CURRENT-DATE is today's date, so no fixed oracle can match
000400*    it. The program checks its own answer instead and reports
000500*    only whether it is well formed: MM/DD/YY, plausible parts.
000600 DATA DIVISION.
000700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000800 01  CD-DATE.
000900     05  CD-MONTH            PIC 99.
001000     05  CD-SL1              PIC X.
001100     05  CD-DAY              PIC 99.
001200     05  CD-SL2              PIC X.
001300     05  CD-YEAR             PIC 99.
001400 01  BAD-SWITCH              PIC X VALUE 'N'.
001500     88  BAD                       VALUE 'Y'.
001600 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001700 000-MAIN.
001800     MOVE CURRENT-DATE TO CD-DATE.
001900     IF CD-SL1 NOT = '/' MOVE 'Y' TO BAD-SWITCH.
002000     IF CD-SL2 NOT = '/' MOVE 'Y' TO BAD-SWITCH.
002100     IF CD-MONTH < 1 MOVE 'Y' TO BAD-SWITCH.
002200     IF CD-MONTH > 12 MOVE 'Y' TO BAD-SWITCH.
002300     IF CD-DAY < 1 MOVE 'Y' TO BAD-SWITCH.
002400     IF CD-DAY > 31 MOVE 'Y' TO BAD-SWITCH.
002500     IF BAD
002600         DISPLAY 'CURRENT-DATE MALFORMED: ' CD-DATE.
002700     IF NOT BAD
002800         DISPLAY 'CURRENT-DATE WELL FORMED'.
002900     STOP RUN.
